End-to-End K8S-Ansible project.
===============================

Flow chart:
----------
1. Spinup the infrastructure through the Terraform files in GitHub:

Jenkins-util server for CICD process and App server for spinup the K8s cluster and run the application in it through Ansible.

2. CICD Process flow:

Developer push the code to GitHub & -> Jenkins pipeline will run -> Build the artifact with maven(.jar file for java springboot application) -> Sonarquebe for static code analysis -> Build the docker image -> trivy image scan -> push the image to dockerhub -> update the deployment manifests in GitHub repo for ansible -> Deployment the manifest in k8s through ansible (Continuous delivery required RFC for the manual approvals from CAB team).


