Continuous deployment vs continuous delivery (In Real time)

For lower environments we use continuous deployment (argoCD)
	- LAB
	- SBOX
	- STAGING
	- UAT

For production level environments we use continuous delivery
	- Raise the CR/RFC in Servicenow -> CAB team(client team, delivery partner, and high level management team)
	- Approval
	- Production deployment

